# 🧱 PHASE 6 — Producer (Publisher)

---

## 👉 `producer/OrderPublisher.java`

```java
package com.example.ordersystemnats.producer;

import com.example.ordersystemnats.model.OrderDTO;
import com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.ObjectMapper;
import io.nats.client.Connection;
import org.springframework.stereotype.Component;

@Component
public class OrderPublisher {

    private final Connection connection;
    private final ObjectMapper objectMapper;

    public OrderPublisher(Connection connection) {
        this.connection = connection;
        this.objectMapper = new ObjectMapper();
    }

    public void publishOrder(OrderDTO order) throws Exception {

        String subject = "orders.created";

        String message = objectMapper.writeValueAsString(order);

        connection.publish(subject, message.getBytes());

        System.out.println("Published Order: " + message);
    }
}
```

---

## 🧠 Line-by-line understanding

```java
connection.publish(subject, message.getBytes());
```

👉 Sends message to NATS

```text
Subject = orders.created
```

Equivalent:

```text
Kafka → topic
```

